\ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 Igros Kodesh, loc. cit., p. 39, states that even
 if a child's birthday is [shortly] after Lag B'Omer, one should not hold the upsherinish on that holiday in Meron. Instead, one should wait until the child's birthday.
\par See also pages 20-21, which lists days on which it is not customary to hold an upsherinish
