\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619  HYPERLINK "http://www.sichosinenglish.org/books/upsherinish/06.htm" \\l "t67" }}{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \cs16\i\f77\fs20\ul\cf6\insrsid14899619 Back to text}}}{\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch 
\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 {\*\bkmkend n67}) Indeed, care should be taken concerning this throughout the day. To whatever extent possible, the child should be exposed
 only to holy sights. See also Siddur Yaakov Emden who explains that for similar reasons the herds of the Jewish people were not permitted near Mount Sinai at the time of the Giving of the Torah.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch \ai\af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 \hich\af77\dbch\af0\loch\f77 68.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li2160\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls69\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0\pararsid14899619 {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 ({\*\bkmkstart n68}}{\field\fldedit{\*\fldinst {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch 
\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619  HYPERLINK "http://www.sichosinenglish.org/books/upsherinish/06.htm" \\l "t68" }}{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \cs16\i\f77\fs20\ul\cf6\insrsid14899619 Back to text}}}{\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch 
\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 {\*\bkmkend n68}) Machzor Vitri.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch \ai\af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 \hich\af77\dbch\af0\loch\f77 69.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li2160\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls70\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0\pararsid14899619 {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 ({\*\bkmkstart n69}}{\field\fldedit{\*\fldinst {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch 
\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619  HYPERLINK "http://www.sichosinenglish.org/books/upsherinish/06.htm" \\l "t69" }}{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch \cs16\i\f77\fs20\ul\cf6\insrsid14899619 Back to text}}}{\rtlch \ai\af0\afs20 \ltrch 
\i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 {\*\bkmkend n69}) This recalls the verses "As the nursemaid will carry the suckling" (Numbers 11:12) which describes Moses' car
e for the Jewish people, and "I have trained Ephraim that [a leader] will take them in his arms" (Hoshea 11:3) which describes G-d's care for the Jewish people.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch \ai\af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch \i\f77\fs20\cf2\insrsid14899619 \hich\af77\dbch\af0\loch\f77 70.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li2160\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
